    // with a blank there instead. uqStarEmit is on while an unquoted expansion is EMITTED
    // (mkWord) and off for every word evalWord emits - the words nested in a ${...} and
    // the command words, whose own unquoted expansions turn it back on - and inside a
    // command substitution; it only changes the star flag and separator a [*] producer
    // hands the runtime. Twin of uqStar in languages/bash-interpreter.abnf.
    var uqStarEmit = false
